1
00:00:18,472 --> 00:00:19,641
<font color="#FFFFFF">Over there, huh...</font>

2
00:00:27,992 --> 00:00:30,630
<font color="#FFFFFF">Any closer and I'll be noticed...</font>

3
00:01:21,339 --> 00:01:22,508
<font color="#FFFFFF">Big Sister...</font>

4
00:01:23,537 --> 00:01:25,934
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you taking those
with you?</font>

5
00:01:26,734 --> 00:01:28,971
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fate must have meant
for this to happen...</font>

6
00:01:29,171 --> 00:01:31,469
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nothing will serve me better
than these</font>

7
00:01:31,499 --> 00:01:33,297
<font color="#FFFFFF">if I'm gonna fight against him...</font>

8
00:01:37,663 --> 00:01:40,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've lived too long a life...</font>

9
00:03:11,399 --> 00:03:16,024
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Retired Granny's Determination</font>

10
00:03:17,493 --> 00:03:21,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">So... that's where his hideout is.</font>

11
00:03:22,987 --> 00:03:24,116
<font color="#FFFFFF">Most likely.</font>

12
00:03:24,316 --> 00:03:26,853
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara's scent was also coming
from that same place.</font>

13
00:03:27,213 --> 00:03:28,212
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see.</font>

14
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:32,378
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have one more favor to ask you.</font>

15
00:03:33,777 --> 00:03:34,646
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

16
00:03:45,735 --> 00:03:47,962
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, are you awake, Naruto?</font>

17
00:03:48,292 --> 00:03:49,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Pakkun...</font>

18
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:52,258
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, Pakkun, I'm counting on you.</font>

19
00:03:53,357 --> 00:03:54,985
<font color="#FFFFFF">See you around then, Naruto!</font>

20
00:04:04,446 --> 00:04:05,615
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei!</font>

21
00:04:05,645 --> 00:04:08,242
<font color="#FFFFFF">Could it be that you've found
the Akatsuki's hideout?</font>

22
00:04:08,712 --> 00:04:11,069
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... We're heading out immediately.</font>

23
00:04:17,733 --> 00:04:19,800
<font color="#FFFFFF">What, Gaara's whereabouts
have been—?</font>

24
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:22,598
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes ma'am! His whereabouts
have just been located.</font>

25
00:04:23,097 --> 00:04:26,154
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Leaf are preparing
to depart immediately!</font>

26
00:04:26,694 --> 00:04:30,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">Understood! Gather
our skilled men immediately!</font>

27
00:04:30,350 --> 00:04:31,449
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will be heading out as well!</font>

28
00:04:31,549 --> 00:04:32,548
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, ma'am!</font>

29
00:04:34,945 --> 00:04:35,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">Temari...</font>

30
00:04:38,342 --> 00:04:39,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro, don't be so reckless!</font>

31
00:04:40,939 --> 00:04:42,578
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need to stay in bed
and take it easy!</font>

32
00:04:45,605 --> 00:04:48,302
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will get Gaara back,
no matter what!</font>

33
00:05:25,794 --> 00:05:28,332
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, as soon
as the Sand is ready,</font>

34
00:05:28,362 --> 00:05:30,859
<font color="#FFFFFF">we'll join them for Gaara's rescue.</font>

35
00:05:30,889 --> 00:05:31,788
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got it?</font>

36
00:05:32,458 --> 00:05:33,427
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry to have kept you waiting!</font>

37
00:05:35,085 --> 00:05:36,124
<font color="#FFFFFF">Temari!</font>

38
00:05:37,023 --> 00:05:38,022
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone's here...</font>

39
00:05:38,851 --> 00:05:41,978
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! Then let's head out!</font>

40
00:05:42,078 --> 00:05:43,017
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait!</font>

41
00:05:46,544 --> 00:05:50,839
<font color="#FFFFFF">Temari... You and the others stay here
in the village and patrol the border.</font>

42
00:05:51,838 --> 00:05:53,407
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you mean by that?</font>

43
00:05:53,567 --> 00:05:55,535
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's an order from... above.</font>

44
00:05:55,764 --> 00:05:56,703
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh...?</font>

45
00:05:57,363 --> 00:05:58,931
<font color="#FFFFFF">Their reasoning is...</font>

46
00:05:58,961 --> 00:06:02,498
<font color="#FFFFFF">if it becomes widely known that
the Kazekage is absent,</font>

47
00:06:02,528 --> 00:06:05,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">there's no telling when other villages
will attack our village...</font>

48
00:06:05,595 --> 00:06:06,494
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't believe this...</font>

49
00:06:06,624 --> 00:06:07,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's all the more reason that</font>

50
00:06:07,992 --> 00:06:11,219
<font color="#FFFFFF">we have to get Gaara back
as soon as possible!</font>

51
00:06:11,818 --> 00:06:13,886
<font color="#FFFFFF">These Leaf people came
all this way</font>

52
00:06:13,916 --> 00:06:16,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">for the very purpose of
going to Gaara's aid!</font>

53
00:06:17,712 --> 00:06:20,610
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara is our Kazekage, right?</font>

54
00:06:21,009 --> 00:06:23,577
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the point if we,
the Sand people, don't go to save him!</font>

55
00:06:24,176 --> 00:06:25,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">But...</font>

56
00:06:25,235 --> 00:06:26,703
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going.</font>

57
00:06:39,361 --> 00:06:42,617
<font color="#FFFFFF">The only Sand Shinobi
you need is me!</font>

58
00:06:43,157 --> 00:06:44,256
<font color="#FFFFFF">Granny Chiyo!</font>

59
00:06:44,316 --> 00:06:45,984
<font color="#FFFFFF">But that's...</font>

60
00:06:47,213 --> 00:06:49,281
<font color="#FFFFFF">I am already retired, you know...</font>

61
00:06:49,311 --> 00:06:52,907
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can do whatever I like.</font>

62
00:06:53,177 --> 00:06:55,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">You really shouldn't overdo it...!</font>

63
00:06:55,704 --> 00:06:58,771
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't you dare treat me
like an old woman!</font>

64
00:07:01,139 --> 00:07:01,898
<font color="#FFFFFF">She jumped!</font>

65
00:07:01,968 --> 00:07:02,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wha—?</font>

66
00:07:05,465 --> 00:07:10,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't doted on my dear grandchild
for a while, after all...</font>

67
00:07:35,505 --> 00:07:37,632
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, we'll head out.</font>

68
00:07:38,062 --> 00:07:42,498
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry... I will try to convince
the higher-ups...</font>

69
00:07:42,697 --> 00:07:45,025
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll follow behind later,
no matter what!</font>

70
00:07:48,192 --> 00:07:51,289
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara will be long rescued
by that time!</font>

71
00:07:51,449 --> 00:07:52,348
<font color="#FFFFFF">See you later!</font>

72
00:08:08,472 --> 00:08:11,798
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn! If only I were
physically fit.</font>

73
00:08:12,068 --> 00:08:13,826
<font color="#FFFFFF">There'd be no stopping me
from going...!</font>

74
00:08:20,559 --> 00:08:22,657
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, we're going a little too fast!</font>

75
00:08:22,817 --> 00:08:25,155
<font color="#FFFFFF">We haven't stopped running
since we left!</font>

76
00:08:25,714 --> 00:08:27,552
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's take a little break!</font>

77
00:08:28,681 --> 00:08:31,249
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tenten, you need more training!</font>

78
00:08:32,278 --> 00:08:33,846
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lee! In front of you!</font>

79
00:08:42,098 --> 00:08:43,696
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait, Guy!</font>

80
00:08:44,495 --> 00:08:45,534
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pakkun!</font>

81
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,119
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto!</font>

82
00:09:03,247 --> 00:09:04,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can I ask you something?</font>

83
00:09:06,513 --> 00:09:09,111
<font color="#FFFFFF">Since when have you been
targeted by the Akatsuki?</font>

84
00:09:18,861 --> 00:09:19,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know...</font>

85
00:09:23,996 --> 00:09:26,723
<font color="#FFFFFF">There was that one time when
two people from the Akatsuki</font>

86
00:09:26,753 --> 00:09:29,191
<font color="#FFFFFF">came to the Leaf Village in order to
make contact with Naruto.</font>

87
00:09:30,250 --> 00:09:32,048
<font color="#FFFFFF">But that was three years ago...</font>

88
00:09:32,248 --> 00:09:34,216
<font color="#FFFFFF">and they've just started
making a move now.</font>

89
00:09:34,515 --> 00:09:36,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know why.</font>

90
00:09:37,143 --> 00:09:39,411
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why did they wait three years?</font>

91
00:09:43,636 --> 00:09:45,574
<font color="#FFFFFF">It could be that it's not because
they didn't want to,</font>

92
00:09:45,604 --> 00:09:47,273
<font color="#FFFFFF">but because they couldn't.</font>

93
00:09:47,972 --> 00:09:51,229
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because Lord Jiraiya was always
hanging close to Naruto...</font>

94
00:09:56,224 --> 00:09:57,323
<font color="#FFFFFF">No...</font>

95
00:09:58,661 --> 00:10:03,486
<font color="#FFFFFF">Based on information I acquired,
there apparently is another reason.</font>

96
00:10:04,655 --> 00:10:06,114
<font color="#FFFFFF">Another... reason?</font>

97
00:10:06,513 --> 00:10:09,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's quite a bit of
preparation involved</font>

98
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:13,177
<font color="#FFFFFF">if one's gonna draw out the Tailed Beast
that's sealed within people.</font>

99
00:10:13,207 --> 00:10:15,005
<font color="#FFFFFF">They encountered difficulties
with that.</font>

100
00:10:25,734 --> 00:10:28,561
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's this "Tailed Beast"
that you were talking about?</font>

101
00:10:28,791 --> 00:10:29,960
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

102
00:10:29,990 --> 00:10:33,926
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're Tsunade's disciple
and you don't even know that?</font>

103
00:10:34,256 --> 00:10:37,283
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Leaf Village had
a Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit...</font>

104
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:42,477
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit is</font>

105
00:10:42,517 --> 00:10:44,915
<font color="#FFFFFF">treated as top secret
amongst the Leaf Village...</font>

106
00:10:45,215 --> 00:10:48,611
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, that's not surprising, I guess...</font>

107
00:10:49,970 --> 00:10:53,207
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Tailed Beast refers to
Beast Spirits with tails.</font>

108
00:10:54,365 --> 00:10:57,662
<font color="#FFFFFF">Long, long ago,
the Sand had a One-Tail.</font>

109
00:10:57,702 --> 00:11:01,528
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's the Shukaku sealed
within Gaara.</font>

110
00:11:01,858 --> 00:11:02,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">One-Tail?</font>

111
00:11:03,696 --> 00:11:05,424
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you mean that there are
other beasts</font>

112
00:11:05,454 --> 00:11:06,793
<font color="#FFFFFF">besides the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit?</font>

113
00:11:06,853 --> 00:11:07,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right...</font>

114
00:11:08,791 --> 00:11:12,318
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are a total of nine
tailed beasts in this world...</font>

115
00:11:13,017 --> 00:11:15,514
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tailed beasts have
special characteristics.</font>

116
00:11:15,714 --> 00:11:18,581
<font color="#FFFFFF">Each of them have
a different number of tails.</font>

117
00:11:19,011 --> 00:11:22,907
<font color="#FFFFFF">The One-Tailed has one tail.
The Two-Tailed has two.</font>

118
00:11:22,937 --> 00:11:25,974
<font color="#FFFFFF">And up to the Nine-Tailed
as the name suggests,</font>

119
00:11:26,004 --> 00:11:28,871
<font color="#FFFFFF">each name represents
the number of tails the beast has.</font>

120
00:11:29,530 --> 00:11:32,327
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Tailed beasts have
immense Chakra</font>

121
00:11:32,367 --> 00:11:34,695
<font color="#FFFFFF">and in the world of Ninja,</font>

122
00:11:34,725 --> 00:11:37,692
<font color="#FFFFFF">they were used for military purposes
by Hidden Villages around the world.</font>

123
00:11:38,192 --> 00:11:40,359
<font color="#FFFFFF">They competed to get
their hands on them.</font>

124
00:11:41,388 --> 00:11:44,385
<font color="#FFFFFF">But no one was able
to control that power</font>

125
00:11:44,415 --> 00:11:47,652
<font color="#FFFFFF">which surpassed human intelligence.</font>

126
00:11:48,511 --> 00:11:52,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know why
the Akatsuki is after it,</font>

127
00:11:53,077 --> 00:11:55,604
<font color="#FFFFFF">but that power is too dangerous...</font>

128
00:11:56,343 --> 00:12:01,898
<font color="#FFFFFF">But in this new peaceful age,
the Tailed beasts apparently...</font>

129
00:12:01,938 --> 00:12:06,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">still exist, having scattered
all around the world...</font>

130
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:23,846
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi directed us,
the Eight Ninja Hounds,</font>

131
00:12:23,876 --> 00:12:25,914
<font color="#FFFFFF">to fan out in every direction</font>

132
00:12:25,944 --> 00:12:28,311
<font color="#FFFFFF">to follow the Akatsuki
Organization's scent.</font>

133
00:12:28,841 --> 00:12:30,609
<font color="#FFFFFF">While we were doing that,
we realized that</font>

134
00:12:30,639 --> 00:12:32,767
<font color="#FFFFFF">those guys were headed towards
the Land of Rivers</font>

135
00:12:32,807 --> 00:12:34,405
<font color="#FFFFFF">which is situated between
the Leaf and Sand.</font>

136
00:12:35,035 --> 00:12:36,204
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Land of Rivers...?</font>

137
00:12:36,933 --> 00:12:37,902
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right.</font>

138
00:12:38,331 --> 00:12:39,660
<font color="#FFFFFF">In other words,</font>

139
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:42,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">you guys are closest to the Akatsuki
at this point in time.</font>

140
00:12:42,827 --> 00:12:45,494
<font color="#FFFFFF">You, who were heading from
the Leaf to the Sand Village.</font>

141
00:12:47,892 --> 00:12:48,951
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...</font>

142
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:53,816
<font color="#FFFFFF">Follow me...
I'll explain the details as we run.</font>

143
00:12:54,615 --> 00:12:56,943
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! Let's go, everybody!</font>

144
00:12:57,043 --> 00:12:58,641
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Already?</font>

145
00:13:35,774 --> 00:13:40,569
<font color="#FFFFFF">An enemy is nearing
this hideout.</font>

146
00:13:41,638 --> 00:13:42,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">An enemy, you said?</font>

147
00:13:43,137 --> 00:13:45,894
<font color="#FFFFFF">And a highly skilled one at that.</font>

148
00:13:45,934 --> 00:13:49,360
<font color="#FFFFFF">His name is... Might Guy.</font>

149
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,728
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who's that?</font>

150
00:13:53,157 --> 00:13:55,824
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Leaf Jonin Ninja who
uses Taijutsu.</font>

151
00:13:55,854 --> 00:13:58,851
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's one clever operator.
Don't underestimate him.</font>

152
00:13:59,021 --> 00:14:02,947
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah... that freak beast, huh...</font>

153
00:14:05,544 --> 00:14:07,372
<font color="#FFFFFF">We will use that Jutsu...</font>

154
00:14:08,971 --> 00:14:10,909
<font color="#FFFFFF">In that case, I'll go...</font>

155
00:14:11,168 --> 00:14:16,034
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was getting irritated for not
having any luck finding a Jinchuriki.</font>

156
00:14:16,403 --> 00:14:19,031
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I'll go...</font>

157
00:14:19,131 --> 00:14:23,726
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have something of a personal quarrel
with him, you see...</font>

158
00:14:24,026 --> 00:14:27,252
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're right. That Jutsu is more suited
to someone like you.</font>

159
00:14:27,292 --> 00:14:29,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Among the Akatsuki,</font>

160
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:32,147
<font color="#FFFFFF">you are more heavily loaded
with Chakra, Kisame.</font>

161
00:14:32,517 --> 00:14:33,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes...</font>

162
00:14:33,686 --> 00:14:36,683
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even so, I'll take 30%
of your Chakra.</font>

163
00:14:38,981 --> 00:14:40,110
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, well, well...</font>

164
00:14:40,139 --> 00:14:42,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like I'll finally be
able to get pay back</font>

165
00:14:42,677 --> 00:14:45,604
<font color="#FFFFFF">for that kick he gave me...</font>

166
00:14:49,101 --> 00:14:51,628
<font color="#FFFFFF">Severe Leaf Hurricane!</font>

167
00:14:57,522 --> 00:14:58,861
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who the heck is he?</font>

168
00:15:00,459 --> 00:15:05,454
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Noble Blue Beast of
the Leaf Village... Mighty Guy.</font>

169
00:15:29,090 --> 00:15:30,030
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's up?</font>

170
00:15:30,729 --> 00:15:31,758
<font color="#FFFFFF">Someone's coming!</font>

171
00:15:36,223 --> 00:15:37,322
<font color="#FFFFFF">Byakugan!</font>

172
00:15:53,406 --> 00:15:54,335
<font color="#FFFFFF">Behind us!</font>

173
00:16:40,819 --> 00:16:42,057
<font color="#FFFFFF">You...</font>

174
00:16:43,986 --> 00:16:46,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you know him, Guy Sensei?</font>

175
00:16:51,348 --> 00:16:52,747
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who are you?</font>

176
00:17:26,213 --> 00:17:27,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">Another guest...</font>

177
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:32,207
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a little noisy this time,
isn't it, Deidara!</font>

178
00:17:33,236 --> 00:17:38,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, the Jinchuriki was
stronger than the other two...</font>

179
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:42,197
<font color="#FFFFFF">I told you at the start, didn't I?</font>

180
00:17:42,357 --> 00:17:46,423
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your Jutsu wasn't suited
for covert operations.</font>

181
00:17:46,753 --> 00:17:51,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd say your traps were
pretty loud too, weren't they?</font>

182
00:17:52,217 --> 00:17:53,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">What!</font>

183
00:17:53,486 --> 00:17:54,944
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop fighting amongst yourselves!</font>

184
00:17:55,884 --> 00:17:57,882
<font color="#FFFFFF">Concentrate on the Jutsu!</font>

185
00:17:58,541 --> 00:18:01,508
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then...
who should I send this time...</font>

186
00:18:01,538 --> 00:18:04,235
<font color="#FFFFFF">This time it's my turn,
without any doubt.</font>

187
00:18:04,405 --> 00:18:07,472
<font color="#FFFFFF">Another Leaf Shinobi...</font>

188
00:18:09,230 --> 00:18:10,299
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn!</font>

189
00:18:11,268 --> 00:18:13,226
<font color="#FFFFFF">In that case, it's decided...</font>

190
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:20,259
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everybody, halt!</font>

191
00:18:33,076 --> 00:18:34,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who is that?</font>

192
00:18:35,674 --> 00:18:37,172
<font color="#FFFFFF">Out of the blue, huh...</font>

193
00:18:38,701 --> 00:18:41,268
<font color="#FFFFFF">That guy... those eyes...</font>

194
00:18:44,135 --> 00:18:45,294
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're...</font>

195
00:18:50,988 --> 00:18:54,355
<font color="#FFFFFF">This guy... has a ridiculous amount
of Chakra.</font>

196
00:18:56,753 --> 00:19:00,849
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've never seen anyone besides
Naruto with that amount of Chakra.</font>

197
00:19:01,448 --> 00:19:02,547
<font color="#FFFFFF">That much...?</font>

198
00:19:03,376 --> 00:19:06,073
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you really saying
you don't remember...?</font>

199
00:19:07,242 --> 00:19:08,841
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me you're...!</font>

200
00:19:10,039 --> 00:19:12,467
<font color="#FFFFFF">It appears that you've remembered...</font>

201
00:19:14,365 --> 00:19:16,403
<font color="#FFFFFF">Have we met before?</font>

202
00:19:19,630 --> 00:19:22,057
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like
the freak beast's intelligence</font>

203
00:19:22,097 --> 00:19:24,795
<font color="#FFFFFF">is at the level of a beast too...</font>

204
00:19:25,154 --> 00:19:29,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well... I'll make you
remember soon...</font>

205
00:19:48,031 --> 00:19:49,770
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi... Uchiha!</font>

206
00:19:51,867 --> 00:19:53,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">Th-That guy is...</font>

207
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:05,384
<font color="#FFFFFF">That guy is... Itachi... Uchiha!</font>

208
00:21:37,562 --> 00:21:39,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">Guy Sensei, what is that?</font>

209
00:21:39,420 --> 00:21:42,217
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lee, that is what we've been
waiting for!</font>

210
00:21:42,287 --> 00:21:44,984
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then that is what all
the surfers long for,</font>

211
00:21:45,014 --> 00:21:48,051
<font color="#FFFFFF">the legendary big wave that
arrives only once every few years...?</font>

212
00:21:48,081 --> 00:21:51,078
<font color="#FFFFFF">Big Thursday! Go, Lee!</font>

213
00:21:51,108 --> 00:21:53,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now is your chance to conquer
that big wave</font>

214
00:21:53,306 --> 00:21:54,645
<font color="#FFFFFF">and become a man!</font>

215
00:21:54,744 --> 00:21:55,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

216
00:21:55,873 --> 00:22:00,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please watch Guy Sensei,
I'll prove to you my fighting spirit!</font>

217
00:22:00,469 --> 00:22:01,967
<font color="#FFFFFF">Will you two stop talking
like that already?</font>

218
00:22:02,597 --> 00:22:04,964
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time: "A Meeting With Destiny"</font>

